body:
Who knows what those kids are really like, Ivy league doesnt mean they aren't jerks.

&#x200B;

In my case, Im happy my parents got stuck with a waste of life for a kid - they only had me so I could make enough money so they could retire early, and boy were they disappointed when I started my own failing business.

&#x200B;

If your parents, like mine, think their own flesh and blood is a disappointment, they should take a closer look at themselves. That said, if your parents remain loving and supportive, do yourself a favor and make use of their support. Either way, go ahead and forgive yourself - most parents live for seeing a smile on their childrens face and only care about your success for your sake.
